OL,4,G1100FChiles on Friday
OL,5,     GAdrian Chiles gets you set for
OL,6,     Gthe weekend with a good-humoured
OL,7,     Glook at the latest news, sport
OL,8,     Gand entertainment. Text 85058 .
OL,9,G1300FElis James and John Robins
OL,10,     GElis has a chance to make history
OL,11,     Gby Cymru Connecting with 5
OL,12,     Gcallers in a row. National pride
OL,13,     Gcan be restored as long as Elis
OL,14,     Gopens his eyes and doesn't go
OL,15,     Gdown a Cymru cul-de-sac.
